{"id":"vd-a1-the-snow-day","level":"a1","n":22,"title":{"en":"Can We Help You?","vi":"Chúng cháu giúp ông được không?"},"summary":"Tuyết chắn kín cửa nhà ông Grant; Hana và Kenji mang xẻng sang hỏi ông cần giúp gì.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-snow-day","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Snow Day","vi":"Ngày nghỉ vì tuyết"}},"scene":{"background":"snow-yard","props":[{"id":"snowman","x":260,"y":720,"back":true}]},"cast":{"hana":{"name":{"en":"Hana","vi":"Hana"},"look":"girl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#1F1C22","sleeve":1,"top":"#E5484D","topShade":"#C73A3F","scarf":"#F2C14E"}},"kenji":{"name":{"en":"Kenji","vi":"Kenji"},"look":"boy","x":770,"style":{"hairColor":"#1F1C22","sleeve":1,"top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA","hat":"cap"}},"grant":{"name":{"en":"Mr. Grant","vi":"Ông Grant"},"look":"grandpa","x":1230,"style":{"top":"#8A7A64","topShade":"#75664F"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"hana","en":"Hello, Mr. Grant! Are you OK?","vi":"Chào ông Grant ạ! Ông có sao không ạ?","ipa":["həˈloʊ","ˈmɪstɚ","ɡɹænt","ɑɹ","ju","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":0.554,"end":4.224,"expression":"worried","gesture":"wave","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.313],[2,1.739],[3,3.323],[4,3.522],[5,3.735]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"Hello, Hana. I can't open my door.","vi":"Chào Hana. Ông không mở cửa được.","ipa":["həˈloʊ","ˈhænə","aɪ","kænt","ˈoʊpən","maɪ","dɔɹ"],"start":5.014,"end":8.704,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,5.014],[1,5.692],[2,7.19],[3,7.389],[4,7.801],[5,8.085],[6,8.256]]},{"speaker":"kenji","en":"Wow, that's a lot of snow!","vi":"Oa, tuyết nhiều quá ông ạ!","ipa":["waʊ","ðæts","ə","lɑt","ʌv","snoʊ"],"start":9.494,"end":11.564,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,9.494],[1,10.149],[2,10.462],[3,10.561],[4,10.917],[5,11.059]]},{"speaker":"hana","en":"Can we help you? We have Dad's shovel.","vi":"Chúng cháu giúp ông được không ạ? Chúng cháu có xẻng của bố đây.","ipa":["kæn","wi","hɛlp","ju","wi","hæv","dædz","ˈʃʌvəl"],"start":12.354,"end":15.914,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,12.3